  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>Q008</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>A key distinction of schistosomal periportal fibrosis from cirrhosis is that:</p>]]></text></questiontext>
    <generalfeedback format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p>Liver function is usually preserved until late (Radiopaedia). Note the liver surface can still look irregular, so contour alone can mimic cirrhosis.</p>]]></text></generalfeedback>
